Package: metawoRld
Title: A Framework for Managing Data in Living Systematic Reviews
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Anders Hagen", "Jarmund", , "anders.h.jarmund@ntnu.no", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3923-1637"))
Description: Provides a structured environment for creating, validating and
    managing data for living systematic reviews. Study metadata and results are
    stored as YAML and CSV files that are validated against a project-specific
    schema, can be loaded for analysis, and can be published as a Quarto
    website. Designed to work with the 'DataFindR' package for AI-assisted
    screening and data extraction.
